              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye mam abu koar ikecedwe, konye kiswama kwape ejaatar nuiwadikatai oitabo loka ikisila luka Musa, kwape kicorakinia EJAKAIT ebe, Mam lukapapa etwakikinete idwekec, karaida idwe atwakikin lukapapakec; konye etwanikini ŋinituŋanan akeronis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
