            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bobo da kotukok Amasia Yuda, kitemonok kes kwape ajaatar ikekia luka lukapapakec, ikapolok luka ilukumin ka ikapolok luka akwat, Yuda kere ka Benyamin: kimara kes ageuni kaluka ikar akaisaarei ka adepar, kodum kes imwaasi ituŋa ilukumin akwat auni lueseunitai, luepedorete alosit ojie, luejenete aitwasam akwara ka ebuku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
