            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Amasia etuŋanan loka Edeke atiar, “Konye kikwaikini do ai nuka atalatan akwatat nuainak ajore naka Isirael? “Koboŋok etuŋanan loka Edeke ebe, “Epedori Edeke ainakin jo nuitelekarito ŋun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi Amasia agitar kes, ajore naabuni mamake koEpuraim, aboŋor ore: ŋes kinepunia anyunyurakec noi aluikin Yuda, kobonosi ore kanyunyura naepol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ika 14:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotitiŋior Amasia, kiŋarenik iketuŋa, kolot Aditot naka Abalaŋ, kodany ilukumin itomon kodwe luka Seir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijoreutu idwe luka Yuda ice ilukumin itomon ejarete, koyaut kes kuju moru, kocakasi kes kokuiu moru, kobilibiliunos, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye ituŋa luka erioŋet loabu Amasia kinyaka, kinyeis aupar kaŋes ojie, kibirokinos ireria luka Yuda, anyoun koSamaria kiton Bet-koron, kodany ilukumin iuni kakesi, koyaŋaasi luŋatuna luipu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
