          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijuka Yoas ekabaka loka Isirael mama ejai Amasia ekabaka loka Yuda, kobala ebe, “Abu ekenep loajai Lebanon kijukak eres loajai Lebanon, ebe, Kokorak akokukon okokuka komany: kitoro etiaŋ loka ais loajai Lebanon, kicakacak ekenep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
